# {{id}}

Optional module, initially unregistered and disabled. Source version: 0.1.0.

Backend namespace: `{{namespace}}`; PostgreSQL schema: `{{schema}}`; storage prefix: `modules/{{owner}}/{{code}}/`. Use ModuleSchema/ModuleModel and ModuleStorage; do not read foreign models, schemas or files.

The initial lifecycle policy is stateless, has no work and accepts null/current installed versions. Replace it with module-owned health/preparation/work/data compatibility decisions when introducing effects.

Run `./bin/artisan runa:modules:check {{owner}}` before synchronization, then `./bin/artisan runa:modules:sync {{owner}}`. Registration never enables Optional modules. Runa update execution manages only Runa modules; application deployment owns application ModuleUpdates invocation.

Run the module tests using `{{test_command}}`. Runtime descriptor contracts can be checked after synchronization with `./bin/artisan runa:modules:check {{owner}} --runtime`.

Generated controllers return 501; generated APIs/Actions refuse execution until implemented. HTTP descriptors derive named `{{id}}.<operation>` routes behind central guards. Add permission declarations and server authorization for protected business operations. Vue components are opt-in, with no default page/slot registration.

Review dependent contracts and update module SemVer and this directory's CHANGELOG.md for implementation changes. See the public module development guide.
